SUMMARY:Vibe Code Fest Basel 2026
LOCATION:FHNW Campus Dreispitz\, Basel
DESCRIPTION:A one-day unconference on building software with AI: morning ke
 ynotes and community talks on vibe coding with design systems\, AI in lab 
 software and vibe marketing\, a panel on where the money goes once softwar
 e is cheap\, then a five-hour build sprint ending in community voting\, pi
 tches and an awards ceremony.\n\nOrganiser: Vibe Code Fest\n\nDetails and 
 registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/vibe-code-fest-basel-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/vibe-code-fest-basel-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
